- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and `git diff --check` — passed.

## Acceptance boundary

This closes the per-client provider callback ownership slice only. Broad
P18-V01 source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow/reverse-export
reconciliation remains open. Native Windows runtime, current-revision remote
Ubuntu CI, and Phase 19 Broker/Docker evidence remain pending. No push or
